  <!--
    The headless emulator (issue #382).

    This is the same emulator core as pureikyubu.vcxproj, built without a window: no SDL
    front end, no ImGui, no OpenGL and no debugger window. It is a console application,
    so it runs unattended on a build server or from a script. The accepted options are
    the usual ones of the emulator (see the help text); the difference is that this build
    never shows a selector, so an image, the Bootrom or a benchmark has to be requested
    on the command line.

    The front end is uinull.cpp, the renderer is the null backend (gfxnull.cpp, selected
    by GFX_NULL), and the video/audio/pad/console back ends are the null ones. See
    uinull.cpp and gfxnull.h for what each of them does.

    Build it on its own (it does not need the SDL2 project, only its headers):

      MSBuild pureikyubu_headless.vcxproj -p:Configuration=Release -p:Platform=x64
  -->
